@startuml
!theme plain
title 实际转账主链：事务边界与结果未知
autonumber
actor 客户 as User
boundary "Gateway / TransferController" as API
control TransferProcessor as Processor
database "Channel PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "FineractTransferPort / Fineract" as Core
User -> API: 付款账户、收款人、金额、幂等键、关联号
group 当前受理事务（存在 M09）
  API -> DB: 身份/收款人读取
  API -> Core: 付款账户归属读取
  note right of API: 此处网络读取仍在渠道事务内
  API -> DB: 幂等记录、CREATED、历史、Outbox、审计
end
API --> User: 202 + transferId
User -> API: confirm
API -> Processor: process(transferId)
group 短事务一
  Processor -> DB: 行锁、风险与提交权
  DB --> Processor: 已提交 PENDING_CLEARING
end
Processor -> Core: 事务外 accountTransfer
note over Processor,Core: 核心提交后响应可能丢失；本地不能凭异常判断未记账
alt 成功或结果不确定
  Processor -> Core: 按关联事实权威回读
  alt 核验找到匹配交易
    group 短事务二
      Processor -> DB: SETTLED、核心引用、回执、投影、通知、Outbox、审计
    end
  else 回读失败/未知
    Processor -> DB: CORE_RESULT_UNKNOWN
    note over Processor,DB: 后续只核验，不盲目二次扣款
  end
else 确定性核心拒绝且回读为空
  Processor -> DB: FAILED
end
API --> User: 当前业务状态与关联号
@enduml
